html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Two working heritage AI probe concepts, the five-to-two selection, and their first low-fidelity prototype round under ERGO 117392."><title>AI &amp; Heritage · Probe Concepts and Round 1</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"><script src="app.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="#overview">AI <span>&amp;</span> Heritage<small>PROBE DEVELOPMENT</small></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation">'''+''.join(f'<a href="#{sid}">{label}</a>' for sid,label in nav)+'''</nav><button id="print" class="quiet-button" type="button">Print</button></header><main id="main">'''+hero+research+'<section id="directions">'+heading('01 / TWO WORKING PROBE CONCEPTS','A and B: the selected directions','These concepts describe the intended interactions and research questions. The first low-fidelity round below explores them through a simpler implementation.')+''.join(direction(d) for d in DIRECTIONS)+'</section>'+(ROOT/'content/first-stage-test.html').read_text(encoding='utf-8')+iteration+'<section id="comparison">'+heading('04 / FIVE-TO-TWO SELECTION','All five, in one table','The table explains the original ideas, theory, book cases and selection. Row 2 leads to A. Rows 4 and 5 lead to B. The Round 1 section separately defines the first implementation and its data.')+comparison+'</section>'+evidence+speculation+objects+sources+'''<footer><p><b>Two working concepts. First prototypes. Further iteration and selection.</b></p><p>Updated 23 October 2026 · Version 2026-10-23-visual-clarity</p><p>Round 1 basis: ERGO 117392 V1.0, 22 October 2026. Recruitment begins after ethics approval. This site explains the designs. Study activities run on separate local equipment.</p><div><a href="archive/initial-five/index.html">Historical five-probe atlas</a><a href="https://github.com/Jackson-jjc/probe_second-round_design">GitHub repository</a><a href="#overview">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer></main></body></html>'''
